          "ar_label": "E2B API Key",
          "en_label": "E2B API Key",
          "where_to_get": {
            "ar": "1. روح e2b.dev وسجّل (مجاني، 100 hours/month)\n2. ادخل e2b.dev/dashboard\n3. اضغط 'Keys' من القائمة الجانبية\n4. انسخ مفتاحك (يبدأ بـ 'e2b_')",
            "en": "1. Go to e2b.dev and sign up (free, 100 hours/month)\n2. Open e2b.dev/dashboard\n3. Click 'Keys' in the sidebar\n4. Copy your key (starts with 'e2b_')"
